widgets_values:
-Set you seed, Steps and CFG

-Seed: If your are not having luck with your results, try changing the seed.

-Steps: More steps means better quality but longer generation time. Its set as "6" by default. Fell free to change it and test new configurations. Use even numbers! 

-CFG: More CFG means better results but lognger generation time. Its set as "1.0" by default.

-USAGE TIPS FOR SMOOTHMIX TXT2VID:
- Low/Mid end PCs: 
Set Steps to "6" on both KSamplers;
KSampler 1 -> end_at_step = "3";
KSampler 2 -> start_at_end = "3".

- High end PCs: 
Set Steps to "10" on both KSamplers;
KSampler 1 -> end_at_step = "5";
KSampler 2 -> start_at_end = "5".

